My kid's got a damn ulcer 'cause of you, so either you take him seriously, or you're gonna be taking me seriously.

277
00:14:57,439 --> 00:14:58,106
Yes, sir?

278
00:14:58,315 --> 00:15:01,416
Janice, why don't you send the little boy in?

279
00:15:01,568 --> 00:15:02,568
Right away.

280
00:15:05,113 --> 00:15:07,199
He'll see you now.

281
00:15:08,367 --> 00:15:09,826
You're up, moonpie.

282
00:15:18,293 --> 00:15:19,293
And here...

283
