You're welcome.

322
00:17:31,510 --> 00:17:33,345
We're real proud of you, honey.

323
00:17:35,347 --> 00:17:37,599
Are you proud of me and Georgie? Of course.

324
00:17:37,807 --> 00:17:38,807
You bet.

325
00:17:39,226 --> 00:17:40,227
For what?

326
